Subject: [PATCH 1939/3799] soh: rename func_8008F128 ->
 Player_HoldsUnattachedHookshot

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: true when the hookshot is held and heldActor is NULL, i.e. the hook is not out
Defined in soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                             |  2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_player_lib.c                         |  3 ++-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_player_actor/z_player.c | 12 ++++++------
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index bd8e4e612..4dc1a6b51 100644
